  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FBDS 2021-25: PlanaFlor: Green New Deal for nature-based economic recovery</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to develop a National Strategic Plan &#x2013; PlanaFlor - to guide economic recovery to promote sustainable development focused on nature-based solutions at a landscape scale.</narrative>
  </description>
